in an interview room that had been bugged with a covert listening device. However, neither teen said anything that incriminated themselves or any others in the crime. They were split up once more when suddenly Matthew Webster made an unexpected confession. Even though the 18-year-old was a suspect, police had no hard evidence against him. It seemed to come out of nowhere. Webster admitted, quote, Well, I did it, but I just couldn't believe it happened. It's just unbelievable. I went to look for my beers and I saw Lee Lee sitting down on the grass and my beers weren't there. Somebody must have pinched them. And then I walked up to Lee Lee and she carried on with

